  "description": "Who held which seat, over which date range. The join that turns a credit on a Position into money for a Payee. Overlapping rows for the same position, or for the same payee, mean a deal pays twice - Mongo cannot express 'no overlapping ranges' as an index, so it is an automation guard with its own status and its own regression case, never a schema promise.",
